 milking machine, heat recovery units, direct expansion type bulk milk coolers, herringbone parlors, IBT based BMC, ice chambers, Kero-Petro milking machines, milk can lids, milk cans, milk meters, milking machines/parlor spares, parallel parlors, RMCUs, rotary parlors, solar BMCs, stainless steel milk buckets and measures, tandem parlors, trolley type milking machines, braising pans, dal cookers, dal storage tanks, digital thaw monitor, distribution vessels, rice cookers, and rice storage chutes. The company was formerly known as Krishna Allied Industries Limited. Krishna Defence and Allied Industries Limited was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India."}}